  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death or Fate sphere</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you are rendered helpless or a creature kills you, you can create a single sphere effect with the curse descriptor as an immediate action before you become helpless or are killed. The curse cannot require a time longer than a standard action to use and must target the creature who rendered you helpless or who killed you. If the curse has a range of touch and the attacker is not within your reach, you can deliver it as a ranged touch attack with a range of close.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc70\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
